{"seq":16,"slug":"collected-works-of-mao","title":"毛泽东文集","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":4,"docCount":10,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/16_collected-works-of-mao","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"毛泽东文集-简介\">毛泽东文集 简介</h1><p>《毛泽东文集》是中共中央文献研究室编、人民出版社出版的大型著作集，共八卷，收录毛泽东1921年至1976年间的重要文稿803篇、约230万字。第一卷于1993年12月毛泽东百年诞辰之际率先出版，其余各卷陆续推出，至1999年年中八卷全部出齐。它是继四卷本《毛泽东选集》之后规模最大的毛泽东著作汇编：选集收约160篇经作者审定的经典定本，文集则以&quot;补选集之未收、存文本之原貌&quot;为编辑取向，大量讲话记录、内部指示、军事电报、书信批注首次公开发表。</p>\n<p>本 hub 是这部八卷本文献的<strong>导读</strong>：不代替原文，而是解决&quot;八卷怎么读、读什么、与选集如何配合&quot;三个问题。它在本 category 中处于<strong>文献入口</strong>位置——单篇专库（如《论十大关系》《反对本本主义》）做逐篇深读，思想史专库做体系梳理，本 hub 提供的是把 803 篇文稿组织成可研读整体的地图与方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想解决的问题</th>\n<th>应去的兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>本 hub 的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选集四卷的定本、修改与出版史</td>\n<td><a href=\"../selected-works-of-mao/\">毛泽东选集</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 第一章第 3 篇只讲文集与选集的配合关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毛泽东思想的完整理论体系</td>\n<td><a href=\"../mao-zedong-thought/\">毛泽东思想概论</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 按文献讲思想，不做纯理论重构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单篇经典的逐句精读</td>\n<td>《论十大关系》《反对本本主义》等单篇专库</td>\n<td>本 hub 告诉你该篇在八卷中的位置与关联篇目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>名句摘编与快速引用</td>\n<td><a href=\"../famous-essays-and-quotes/\">名篇名句</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 强调语境还原，反对断章摘句</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>军事战略专题</td>\n<td><a href=\"../mao-military-thought/\">毛泽东军事思想</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 只标注第四卷电报类文献的分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>先建地图</strong>：读第一章<a href=\"overview-study-guide/eight-volumes-structure-overview\">八卷本结构概述</a>，弄清分卷逻辑、编辑体例与各卷时段。</li>\n<li><strong>再定路线</strong>：按<a href=\"overview-study-guide/study-roadmap-recommended-path\">学习路线图与推荐路径</a>选择通读、专题或问题驱动方案，并配好年谱等工具书。</li>\n<li><strong>后入文本</strong>：进入第二章按时期选读关键篇目分析，第三章沿哲学方法论、经济文化两条主题线做贯通阅读，第四章反思文集的研究价值与能力迁移。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>中国近现代史基本框架：知道 1921 年建党、1927 年井冈山、1935 年遵义会议、1949 年建国、1956 年三大改造完成、1978 年改革开放这些节点即可。</li>\n<li>《毛泽东选集》的粗略印象：至少翻过其中三五篇（如《实践论》《论持久战》），否则难以体会文集的增量价值。</li>\n<li>文献版本常识：知道&quot;初版/修订版/选编本&quot;的区别，能理解&quot;定本&quot;与&quot;原貌&quot;之争为何重要。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>定本谱系的另一端：<a href=\"../selected-works-of-mao/\">毛泽东选集</a></li>\n<li>思想体系的整体梳理：<a href=\"../mao-zedong-thought/\">毛泽东思想概论</a></li>\n<li>从文集中长出的三篇方法论文本的深读：<a href=\"../against-book-worship/\">反对本本主义</a>、<a href=\"../on-ten-major-relationships/\">论十大关系</a>、<a href=\"../on-correctly-handling-contradictions/\">关于正确处理人民内部矛盾的问题</a></li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"overview-study-guide","title":"概述与学习指南","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/overview-study-guide","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eight-volumes-structure-overview","title":"八卷本结构概述","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/overview-study-guide/eight-volumes-structure-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"study-roadmap-recommended-path","title":"学习路线图与推荐路径","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/overview-study-guide/study-roadmap-recommended-path"},{"seq":3,"slug":"relationship-to-selected-works","title":"与《毛泽东选集》的关系","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/overview-study-guide/relationship-to-selected-works"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"key-periods-analysis","title":"重要时期文章分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/key-periods-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pre-1949-key-writings","title":"建国前重要篇目","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/key-periods-analysis/pre-1949-key-writings"},{"seq":2,"slug":"socialist-construction-writings","title":"社会主义建设时期文章","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/key-periods-analysis/socialist-construction-writings"},{"seq":3,"slug":"later-period-reflections","title":"晚期重要论述","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/key-periods-analysis/later-period-reflections"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"thematic-reading","title":"专题阅读","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/thematic-reading","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-methodology-threads","title":"哲学方法论线索","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/thematic-reading/philosophy-methodology-threads"},{"seq":2,"slug":"economic-cultural-threads","title":"经济文化建设线索","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/thematic-reading/economic-cultural-threads"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"research-value","title":"研究价值","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/research-value","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"academic-research-significance","title":"学术研究意义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/research-value/academic-research-significance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"practical-skill-development","title":"实践能力培养","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/collected-works-of-mao/research-value/practical-skill-development"}]}]}